    "subject": "Booking confirmed — {{bookingReference}}",
    "textBody": "Hello {{guestName}},\n\nThank you for booking {{cottageName}} with {{brandName}}. We're delighted you'll be joining us for a countryside escape.\n\nLook forward to slower mornings, fresh air and a few days at your own pace.\n\nYour arrival\nCheck-in: {{checkInTime}}\nCheck-out: {{checkOutTime}}\n\nFinding us\n{{propertyAddress}}\nhttps://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Home%20Farm%2C%20Hamptworth%2C%20SP5%202DS\n\nBooking reference: {{bookingReference}}\nCottage: {{cottageName}}\nCheck-in: {{checkIn}}\nCheck-out: {{checkOut}}\nNights / guests: 3 / {{guests}}\nTotal: {{total}}\nTotal paid: {{total}} ({{paymentStatus}})\n\nPlease keep your booking reference handy. For any questions before your stay, get in touch through our booking website below.\n\nExplore {{brandName}}: {{brandSiteUrl}}\nPlan your stay: {{bookingSiteUrl}}\n\nManage your booking: {{manageUrl}}\n\nCancellation policy: {{cancellationPolicy}}\n\nWarm wishes,\nThe {{brandName}} Team",
